Scope of audit
--------------
The linked Go package reports contain no GPL/AGPL classifications. Assembly
files reported by the tool are Go/x packages, xxhash and modernc sources;
their upstream notices are retained. The automated report is supplemented
by root-level third-party license files and is not a provenance guarantee.

Tailwind CLI and nFPM are build tools; they are not included in the Go binary.
Linux, QEMU, systemd, ISC DHCP, Scapy and distribution packages in optional
Docker/VM test images are external test tools with their own licenses. Those
images and their operating systems are not relicensed as Apache-2.0.
The Swagger UI page loads swagger-ui-dist from unpkg at view time; its
upstream Apache-2.0 package is not vendored in the GoDHCP binary.
